# Build context for the sandcastle image is the repo root (the build is run with
# `--containerfile .sandcastle/Containerfile` so COPY can reach the root manifests).
# The Containerfile only needs pyproject.toml + uv.lock, so exclude everything
# else — notably runs/ (~11G), .venv, .venv-sandcastle, node_modules, and .git —
# to keep the context small and the build fast.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
